=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
The posts were annotated as quote-response pairs with a scalar Fact vs. Feeling rating ranging from -5 to +5, with each pair annotated by 5–7 annotators.

The IAC corpus includes 10,003 Quote-Response (Q-R) pairs with annotations for FACTUAL vs. FEELING argument style, where the quote mechanism lets participants break down a previous post and respond to each component [7]. Fact vs. Feeling was measured as a scalar ranging from -5 to +5, following prior work suggesting that taking the means of scalar annotations reduces noise in Mechanical Turk annotations, and each pair was annotated by 5-7 annotators [5]. The corpus includes quote-response pairs manually annotated with respect to whether the response is primarily a FACTUAL or FEELING based argument [6].
